OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly dry
OL,6,Fand clear start to the evening with
OL,7,Frain moving into the south. Turning
OL,8,Fshowery and possibly heavy, with
OL,9,Fpossible thundery outbreaks, in places
OL,10,Fas cloud lowers. Slightly warmer than
OL,11,Fprevious nights.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FShowers drift northwards
OL,14,Fthrough the morning, turning drier for
OL,15,Fa time in the afternoon. Some more
OL,16,Fisolated, heavy or thundery, showers
OL,17,Fmay return midafternoon. Warmer than
OL,18,FTuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
